OL,3,GNEWSAThree seriously hurt in
OL,4,Atwo-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been seriously
OL,7,Finjured in a two-vehicle crash in
OL,8,FSpalding, police have said.
OL,10,FLincolnshire Police said the incident,
OL,11,Finvolving a black Volvo C30 and a blue
OL,12,FSkoda Karoq, took place on Fulney Drove
OL,13,Fat about 16:15 BST on Saturday.
OL,15,F"Multiple people sustained injuries in
OL,16,Fthe collision and investigators are
OL,17,Furging members of the public to come
OL,18,Fforward if they have information," a
OL,19,Fspokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
